<title>TURKEY: TURK SISE CAM H1 PROFIT AT 1.9 TRLN LIRA.</title>
<headline>TURK SISE CAM H1 PROFIT AT 1.9 TRLN LIRA.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan-June 1997 final</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>				    -------	   -------</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)   171.08  vs     292.95</p>
<p>    Net profit		  1,916.08  vs   1,640.55</p>
<p>    Net sales		     906.77  vs     486.28</p>
<p>    Operating loss		 16.18  vs	29.01 profit</p>
<p>    Exceptional income	2,252.37  vs   1,843.14</p>
<p>    Interest paid		 112.44  vs	 0.05</p>
<p>    Total debts		 3,449.56  vs   2,455.86</p>
<p>    Equity		     16,215.73  vs   9,483.62</p>
<p>    Capital		    11,200.00  vs   5,600.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Turkey's glass and glassware maker T.Sise Cam Fabrikalari AS is owned 74.91 percent by Turkiye Is Bankasi, one of the leading commercial banks.</p>
<p>Sise Cam is the parent company of the group including 20 production, marketing, packaging firms.</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 78 percent year-on-year consumer price inflation in June.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212 275 08 75</p>
</text>
